-    /// v31.0.0 (CIRISPersist#650/#656) — **THE GAP THAT WAS, AND IS CLOSED.**
-    ///
-    /// A marker ("this corpus is migrated, skip the scan") is safe if and only
-    /// if a v30-shaped row cannot appear AFTER the migration. When this witness
